{"title": "College of Swords", "pageid": 6740, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/College_of_Swords", "categories": ["Subclasses"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>\n<b>College of Swords</b> is one of the <a href=\"/wiki/Bard#Level_3\" title=\"Bard\">Subclasses</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Bard\" title=\"Bard\">Bard</a>. These Bards focus entirely on improving their own combat prowess by combining the <a href=\"/wiki/Extra_Attack\" title=\"Extra Attack\">Extra Attack</a> passive, being able to use <a href=\"/wiki/Bardic_Inspiration_(resource)\" title=\"Bardic Inspiration (resource)\">Bardic Inspiration</a> charges for utility and multi-attacks, and being the only Bard Subclass able to have a <a href=\"/wiki/Fighting_Style\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fighting Style\">Fighting Style</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r356266\">.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{display:grid;margin:10px 4px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{padding:8px 16px;margin:auto}@media screen and (max-width:779px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-top:10px;padding:8px 2px;border-left:0!important;grid-row:2;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:3;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{justify-content:center!important}}@media screen and (min-width:780px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left{margin-left:10px;border-left:2px solid #3d3d3d!important;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-right:10px;border-left:0!important;border-right:2px solid #3d3d3d;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:3}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:1}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:2;grid-column:2}}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{margin-left:auto;margin-right:32px;font-size:smaller;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{font-size:300%;font-family:serif;color:#3d3d3d;line-height:1em}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin{margin-bottom:auto;margin-right:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{margin-top:auto;margin-left:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text{font-style:italic}</style><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: center\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 100px; height: 100px; clip-path: none;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Class_Bard_Swords_Badge_Icon.png/100px-Class_Bard_Swords_Badge_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Class_Bard_Swords_Badge_Icon.png/150px-Class_Bard_Swords_Badge_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Class_Bard_Swords_Badge_Icon.png/200px-Class_Bard_Swords_Badge_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Class_Bard_Swords_Badge_Icon.png/100px-Class_Bard_Swords_Badge_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/54/Class_Bard_Swords_Badge_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 120%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">A highly trained and skilled warrior, you use your prowess with words and weapons to fight and entertain in equal measure.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Subclass_features\">Subclass features</span></h2>\n<p><i>This subclass obtains all the features from its base class, <a href=\"/wiki/Bard\" title=\"Bard\">Bard</a>, in addition to its unique features outlined below.</i>\n</p>\n<div class=\"level-progression\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Level_3\">Level 3</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Gain <b><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour#List_of_medium_armour\" title=\"Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/25px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/38px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/50px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Medium armour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/25px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour#List_of_medium_armour\" title=\"Armour\">Medium armour</a> Proficiency</b></li>\n<li>Gain <b><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scimitars\" title=\"Scimitars\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Scimitars_Icon.png/25px-Scimitars_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Scimitars_Icon.png/38px-Scimitars_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Scimitars_Icon.png/50px-Scimitars_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Scimitars\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Scimitars_Icon.png/25px-Scimitars_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/be/Scimitars_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scimitars\" title=\"Scimitars\">Scimitars</a> Proficiency</b></li></ul>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-hrule nomobile\" style=\"user-select: none;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><picture><img src=\"/w/images/b/be/Bg3_content_hr.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"460\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/be/Bg3_content_hr.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Blade_Flourish\" title=\"Blade Flourish\">Blade Flourish</a></dt>\n<dd>Gain access to the following flourishes:</dd></dl>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:120px;\" scope=\"col\">Blade Flourish\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:500px;\" scope=\"col\">Description\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:250px; text-align: top;\" scope=\"col\">Grants\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Defensive Flourish\n</th>\n<td>Attack defensively, increasing your <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> by 4 if you hit.\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Defensive_Flourish_(Melee)\" title=\"Defensive Flourish (Melee)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/Defensive_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp/40px-Defensive_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/61/Defensive_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp/60px-Defensive_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/61/Defensive_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp/80px-Defensive_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Defensive Flourish (Melee)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/Defensive_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp/40px-Defensive_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/61/Defensive_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Defensive_Flourish_(Melee)\" title=\"Defensive Flourish (Melee)\">Defensive Flourish (Melee)</a></span><br>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Defensive_Flourish_(Ranged)\" title=\"Defensive Flourish (Ranged)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Defensive_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp/40px-Defensive_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Defensive_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp/60px-Defensive_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Defensive_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp/80px-Defensive_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Defensive Flourish (Ranged)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Defensive_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp/40px-Defensive_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Defensive_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Defensive_Flourish_(Ranged)\" title=\"Defensive Flourish (Ranged)\">Defensive Flourish (Ranged)</a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Slashing Flourish\n</th>\n<td>Attack up to 2 enemies at once.\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slashing_Flourish_(Melee)\" title=\"Slashing Flourish (Melee)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/37/Slashing_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp/40px-Slashing_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/37/Slashing_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp/60px-Slashing_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/37/Slashing_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp/80px-Slashing_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slashing Flourish (Melee)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/37/Slashing_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp/40px-Slashing_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/37/Slashing_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Slashing_Flourish_(Melee)\" title=\"Slashing Flourish (Melee)\">Slashing Flourish (Melee)</a></span><br>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slashing_Flourish_(Ranged)\" title=\"Slashing Flourish (Ranged)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/96/Slashing_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp/40px-Slashing_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/96/Slashing_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp/60px-Slashing_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/96/Slashing_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp/80px-Slashing_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slashing Flourish (Ranged)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/96/Slashing_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp/40px-Slashing_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/96/Slashing_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Slashing_Flourish_(Ranged)\" title=\"Slashing Flourish (Ranged)\">Slashing Flourish (Ranged)</a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Mobile Flourish\n</th>\n<td>Thrust your weapon with enough force to push your target back 6 m (20 ft). Afterwards, you can <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mobile_Flourish:_Teleport\" title=\"Mobile Flourish: Teleport\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/01/Mobile_Flourish_Teleport_Icon.webp/25px-Mobile_Flourish_Teleport_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/01/Mobile_Flourish_Teleport_Icon.webp/38px-Mobile_Flourish_Teleport_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/01/Mobile_Flourish_Teleport_Icon.webp/50px-Mobile_Flourish_Teleport_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Teleport\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/01/Mobile_Flourish_Teleport_Icon.webp/25px-Mobile_Flourish_Teleport_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/01/Mobile_Flourish_Teleport_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mobile_Flourish:_Teleport\" title=\"Mobile Flourish: Teleport\">Teleport</a> to the target.\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mobile_Flourish_(Melee)\" title=\"Mobile Flourish (Melee)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Mobile_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp/40px-Mobile_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Mobile_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp/60px-Mobile_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Mobile_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp/80px-Mobile_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mobile Flourish (Melee)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Mobile_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp/40px-Mobile_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bf/Mobile_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Mobile_Flourish_(Melee)\" title=\"Mobile Flourish (Melee)\">Mobile Flourish (Melee)</a></span><br>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mobile_Flourish_(Ranged)\" title=\"Mobile Flourish (Ranged)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Mobile_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp/40px-Mobile_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Mobile_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp/60px-Mobile_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Mobile_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp/80px-Mobile_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mobile Flourish (Ranged)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Mobile_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp/40px-Mobile_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Mobile_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Mobile_Flourish_(Ranged)\" title=\"Mobile Flourish (Ranged)\">Mobile Flourish (Ranged)</a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-hrule nomobile\" style=\"user-select: none;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><picture><img src=\"/w/images/b/be/Bg3_content_hr.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"460\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/be/Bg3_content_hr.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div>\n<dl>\n<dt><a href=\"/wiki/Fighting_Style\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fighting Style\">Fighting Style</a></dt>\n<dd><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Duelling\" title=\"Duelling\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Duelling_Icon.webp/30px-Duelling_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Duelling_Icon.webp/45px-Duelling_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Duelling_Icon.webp/60px-Duelling_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duelling\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Duelling_Icon.webp/30px-Duelling_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Duelling_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Duelling\" title=\"Duelling\">Duelling</a></span></dt><dd>When you are wielding a melee weapon that is not Two-Handed in one hand, and no weapon in the other, you deal an additional 2 damage with that weapon.</dd>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Two-Weapon_Fighting\" title=\"Two-Weapon Fighting\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Two-Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp/30px-Two-Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Two-Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp/45px-Two-Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Two-Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp/60px-Two-Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Two-Weapon Fighting\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Two-Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp/30px-Two-Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/54/Two-Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Two-Weapon_Fighting\" title=\"Two-Weapon Fighting\">Two-Weapon Fighting</a></span></dt><dd>When you make an offhand attack, you can add your <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Score_Modifier\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Score Modifier\">Ability Score Modifier</a> to the damage of the attack.</dd>\n</dl></dd>\n</dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Level_6\">Level 6</span></h3>\n<dl><dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Extra_Attack\" title=\"Extra Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/60px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/80px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Extra Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Extra_Attack\" title=\"Extra Attack\">Extra Attack</a></span></dt><dd>You can make an additional free attack after making an unarmed or weapon attack.</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/College_of_Swords\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferre